    {
      "id": "Excalibur - Recon-T1589-Gather Victim Identity Information",
      "name": "Excalibur - Recon-T1589-Gather Victim Identity Information",
      "description": "Enumerates victim identity information from the foothold: local users and groups (net user / net localgroup), members of privileged groups (Administrators, Remote Desktop Users, Remote Management Users), domain users and privileged group membership via LDAP if domain-joined (falls back gracefully on workgroup), service account enumeration (services running as non-SYSTEM/LocalService accounts), and Active Directory user enumeration via System.DirectoryServices.DirectorySearcher. The combination of net.exe user/group commands and LDAP queries from a non-admin-tool process is a MDE identity reconnaissance signal.",
