      "name": "Excalibur - Recon-T1595.001-Scanning-IP-Blocks",
      "description": "Simulates scanning of IP blocks from a foothold machine (T1595.001). Scans a /24 subnet around the target IP with randomized timing and port selection to mimic real adversary behavior. Generates MDE network telemetry for detection testing.",
